{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "72e624b6055e1bc3f88c38a896cbe832c2c02dc770412cea6ce3746ce92aa71c", "ja": "ギャル学講座！　フィールドワーク", "zh": "辣妹学讲座！ 实地考察", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e5f8f471677bef471a9d6107f9fb54c6dfb78ca845dcb35a7a43433cf4293bdb", "ja": "番組を通じて、少しずつギャル度が上がって\nきたアイドル達。成果を発揮するため、町に\n繰り出すことに。美希も加わったところへ、\n通りすがりのギャルが現れ、交流する。やは\nり本物は違う、と感心する一同。", "zh": "通过节目的熏陶，偶像们的辣妹程度逐渐提升。为了展现成果，她们决定上街。美希也加入后，一名路过的辣妹出现，与她们进行了交流。大家不禁感叹，果然真正的辣妹就是不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "4e9ded574994c84883fa7a0050ee544c54b2199d98d6dde1fd19d36c9e1f11bd", "ja": "あたしたち、かなりギャルに近づいてきた気が\nするべさ！　というわけでー……", "zh": "我觉得我们已经变得很像辣妹了吧！所以呢——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "ac7353f5cfcbb5c526eee43571d5799e697c029bf3699ea1fcac6eed8b5c74ea", "ja": "じゃーんっ！　街に出てきちゃいました。\nギャルの実地研修ですよーっ！", "zh": "锵锵！我们来到街上啦。\n这是辣妹的实地研修哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "653b066773100615ec407dbe4791f718da7cad2fd798246e3d83f18bdbc7f488", "ja": "勉強の成果を見せないとねぇ。あたし……あーし、\n頑張るべ……頑張るじゃん。じゃーん？", "zh": "得让大家看看学习的成果呢。我……啊不，是我，\n会加油的……会加油的嘛。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "c1924c587e35ff0192d627404b34142d6d4d1a932d940ab6e7786eb25661dc52", "ja": "やっほー！　やよい、ひなた。ここからはミキが\n案内するね。ギャルっぽいとこ連れてくよ☆", "zh": "呀吼～！弥生、日向。接下来就由美希\n来给你们带路吧。带你们去很有辣妹风范的地方哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "424571e920c541c6cabea40bd252ac56bf664e2d4656a205da8df727800cb989", "ja": "わぁ、美希さん、頼もしいべさ～。\nそれで、どこに行くのがギャルっぽいんかなぁ？", "zh": "哇，美希姐，真可靠呀～  \n那么，去哪里才有辣妹风呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "8aec040c81ca5386de5c22883b376ba303ca99b6696dc05edc4092c74647756a", "ja": "それはねー、……んー。おにぎりのお店に\n行くの！", "zh": "这个嘛——……嗯。要去饭团店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "1fc8a31f4ab257541a09319f8a504533d604a67527c0ce3359dc8700e822d9ad", "ja": "おにぎりって、ギャルっぽいんですか！？\n知らなかった……！", "zh": "饭团看起来很辣妹风吗！？\n我都不知道……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "b04df05112b761fe5ee60b82f73771d8f8aa385c58105b70dc08d10c3ad40154", "ja": "ううん？　ギャルっぽくはないよ。\nただミキが食べたいだけ。", "zh": "不是哦？饭团才不像辣妹风呢。\n只是美希想吃而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "259590186f7a30d6404af94114fcd9e6a48cedc682b1a3a1e71129bdebb2bd62", "ja": "ええっ！？　自由ーっ！", "zh": "诶！？　好自由——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1009_null", "source_sha256": "1f4acf8160d24e07d1920cd9bf2bca583181103bdec4bff20765a1c491612dff", "ja": "ちょえ、765プロの美希ちゃんじゃね？\nやばー！　ウチらツイてね！？　握手してくださーい！", "zh": "喂，那不是765Pro的美希吗？  \n糟了——！我们也太走运了吧！？请和我们握手——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "13438697097ce3ecedf6fa2f24b9899141bc1221e96539b24140453a74a60672", "ja": "いーよ。写真もOKだよ！　はい、チーズ！", "zh": "好啊。拍照也没问题哦！来，茄子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "22c436dac3ef69c70d489361eb8240a3ec2fbe9de76888e55382af988f5ecd40", "ja": "あっ、見てひなたちゃん！　あの人たちのアレ、\nギャルピースだよ！　本物のギャルピだ！", "zh": "啊，你看日向！那群人的那个——是辣妹剪刀手！真正的辣妹剪刀手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "a3b6ef0d24270b93d0a2216e3227f6ea75e94439f1c16086fa1a4406fb73bf14", "ja": "はや～、すごいねぇ……。\n本物のギャルピはやっぱりキレが違うねぇ。", "zh": "哇～好厉害呀……  \n真正的gal pose果然不一样，动作真利落呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_03_1013_null", "source_sha256": "f2ec11833faf80ebd4041386c96feba8ffcfdd3e0de796e9f4c22738c74951a5", "ja": "ちょえ、やよいちゃんとひなたちゃんもいるじゃん！\nあー今日やばー！　うちらと写真撮って！", "zh": "等等，弥生和日向也在啊！\n啊——今天太棒了！和我们一起拍张照吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
